      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOLLER NUFF (4) has had a quiet start to the campaign, but this looks a winning opportunity. CJP now hops on board and the blinkers go on for the first time. Out to this trip for the first time looks to suit on what we've seen this time in, and he can bounce back to winning ways now. DECORATION (3) won well two back before a narrow defeat to the handy Western Miss most recently in a BM66+ over the mile. On the quick backup again, but he's placed at this track and trip and he can make his presence felt once again. ARCADIA KNIGHT (1) got back and never got into the race over 2200m last start. The visors go back on now, with the slight drop in trip and the better gate may hold the key. Expecting a much better effort this time. GINGER GREEN (5) missed narrowly in the Western Miss race last start and that looks a strong form reference for this. NOBLE CONNECTION (2) looks set for improvement out in trip now.",
